    "body": "# Changelog\r\n\r\nEvery update is meant to make Echo a little better from every corner. Not everything here will be for you, but there's something in this release for most people: smarter sound tuning, a cleaner look, and a lot of small fixes that make everyday listening smoother. Here's what's new.\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n## Highlights\r\n\r\n- Block artists and hide their songs across Home, Search, and Queue.\r\n- Find the best equalizer profile for your headphones or earbuds by searching the AutoEq database in the Advanced Equalizer.\r\n- Clear upcoming recommendations from the queue, with confirmation and undo.\r\n- Animated Canvas artwork and a redesigned settings panel in Ambient Mode.\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n## New Features\r\n\r\n### Content and Library\r\n- **Blocked Artists:** Block artists from their profile. Their songs are filtered out of the Home feed, Search, and Queue.\r\n- **Blocked Artists management:** New screen in Content Settings, styled with Material 3 grouped lists.\r\n- **Local folder scanning:** Added Include and Exclude modes to the local song scan, selectable in the scan sheet (#490).\r\n\r\n### Equalizer\r\n- **AutoEq integration:** Search the AutoEq database by headphone or earbud model directly from the Advanced Equalizer tab, and apply a profile tuned for your device.\r\n- **Automatic mapping:** The profile's graphic EQ curve is converted to the app's 10-band format.\r\n- **Automatic activation:** Equalizer processing is enabled when an AutoEq profile is applied.\r\n\r\n### Player\r\n- **Clear Queue:** Remove upcoming recommendations from the queue. The action goes through a confirmation and undo flow (#493).\r\n- **Wavy play/pause toggle:** New Appearance setting to switch the wavy play/pause button to a standard circle. Applies to the main player and mini-player.\r\n- **Explicit badge tint:** The explicit (E) badge now uses the same dynamic tint as the artist name, so it stays visible against album art.\r\n\r\n### Ambient Mode\r\n- **Canvas artwork:** Animated Canvas artwork is now supported in Ambient Mode (#461, #462).\r\n- **Live settings panel:** Adjust lyrics font size, animation, and spacing without leaving Ambient Mode.\r\n- **Hide album art:** New option to centre lyrics by hiding the album art.\r\n- **Simplified controls:** The Back and Settings buttons are replaced by a single Material 3 dropdown menu.\r\n\r\n### Listening Summary\r\n- **Vibe Summary:** A dynamic vibe is now generated from your listening history.\r\n- **Improved genre detection:** Broader keyword matching for Rock, Pop, Jazz, Hip-Hop, Classical, and more.\r\n- **Smarter fallback:** Uncategorised music now falls back to \"Diverse\" instead of overriding a recognised genre with \"Mixed / Unknown\".\r\n\r\n### AI\r\n- **Requesty provider:** Requesty is now available as an AI provider (#448).\r\n- **Clearable API keys:** API key fields can now be cleared and saved empty. The key dialog includes an advanced reset option (#492).\r\n\r\n### Lyrics\r\n- **Download with metadata:** Lyrics can now be downloaded with metadata, and this is enabled by default.\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n## Improvements\r\n\r\n### Interface\r\n- **Queue screen:** Redesigned with Material 3 grouped cards (surfaceVariant, seamless spacing, dynamic corners) to match Settings.\r\n- **Menus and dialogs:** Equalizer, Advanced (Tempo/Pitch), and Song Info menus now use grouped, rounded `surfaceContainerHigh` cards. Tempo and Pitch controls are separated, with improved padding and right-aligned controls.\r\n- **Settings layout:** Listening Summary now has its own distinct block below the Accounts and AI Hub group.\r\n- **Ambient options:** Removed from Appearance Settings, as they are now available inside Ambient Mode.\r\n- **Equalizer sheet:** Uses a ModalBottomSheet with `skipPartiallyExpanded` to resolve nested scroll issues.\r\n\r\n### Lyrics Translation\r\n- Improved timeout handling and clearer connection error messages.\r\n- Translation status now dismisses automatically.\r\n\r\n### Local Media\r\n- Local songs no longer require a stream format to appear in the UI.\r\n- Song menu is simplified for local tracks: radio, refetch, and download are hidden, and sharing uses the local audio file.\r\n- Storage permission state refreshes when the app resumes.\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n## Bug Fixes\r\n\r\n- Fixed the Home screen carousel auto-scroll timer drifting out of sync with user swipes.\r\n- Fixed the custom font not applying across the app UI after import.\r\n- Fixed the Welcome dialog appearing on every app launch.\r\n- Fixed the playback queue not being restored after an app restart (#489).\r\n- Fixed mini-player metadata visibility under the liquid glass effect (#489).\r\n- Fixed a \"Service not registered\" crash in `MainActivity.onDestroy`.\r\n- Fixed local tracks being wiped by accidental or empty scans. Completed folder-filter rejections are now distinguished from empty scans (#490).\r\n- Fixed YouTube API calls being made for local album and artist entities (#490).\r\n- Fixed shuffle order, queue validation, and menu policy in the Clear Queue flow.\r\n- Fixed a streaming OkHttp call not being cancelled with its coroutine in lyrics translation. A call timeout was added.\r\n- Fixed the translation status reset affecting unrelated errors.\r\n- Fixed Ambient Mode layout issues in landscape orientation.\r\n- Fixed a race condition with DataStore initialisation during `MainActivity` startup.\r\n- Fixed ListItem and Queue padding and background overdraw issues.\r\n- Fixed the stream selection logic to validate that the URL is non-empty before updating the best stream (#489).\r\n- Fixed the ShowMediaInfo list hard-coded background so the bottom sheet surface colour applies correctly.\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n## Internal\r\n\r\n- Version bumped to 1.4.1 (versionCode 162).\r\n- Optimised database queries, DataStore caching, and token provider deduplication (#489).\r\n- Applied Spotless and ktlint formatting.\r\n- Removed accidentally committed temporary files.\r\n- Indexed the new Wavy Play/Pause setting in settings search.\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n## Contributors\r\n\r\nThank you to everyone who contributed to this release.\r\n\r\n- @iad1tya : Maintainer. Blocked Artists, AutoEq integration, Ambient Mode overhaul, Listening Summary, theme and UI refinements, release management.\r\n- @VardhmanSurana : Clear Queue action (#493), local folder scan modes and local media fixes (#490), playback queue restore and mini-player fixes (#489), API key removal and lyrics translation fixes (#492).\r\n- @Roshan-aa11 : Canvas artwork in Ambient Mode (#461, #462).\r\n- @Thibaultjaigu : Requesty AI provider (#448).",
