    "body": "# Changelog\r\n\r\n**Summary:** This release adds the My Bottom 50 playlist, faster and more efficient playback (Opus audio and HTTP/3 on by default), a restored and refined Liquid Glass interface, and several performance and layout fixes.\r\n\r\n## Added\r\n\r\n- **My Bottom 50 playlist:** An auto-playlist of your 50 least-played tracks, mirroring My Top 50. It supports period filtering, shuffle, play, queue, download, multi-select and search. It can be toggled in Appearance settings and is indexed in settings search. Contributed by @andrewvalletta (#420).\r\n- **Ahead-of-time track preloading:** The first 2 MB of the next queued track is now cached in advance, removing loading spinners and gaps between tracks.\r\n- **Network optimizations:**\r\n  - TCP connection pooling for ExoPlayer.\r\n  - Cronet (HTTP/3) integration.\r\n  - Emergency Piped API fallback for 403 blocks, which fixes infinite loading.\r\n  - Option to force Opus audio (itag 251).\r\n  - New toggles for Cronet and Opus in Content settings.\r\n- **Liquid Glass gliding selector:** A spring-animated indicator now follows the active tab in the bottom navigation bar.\r\n- **Ambient mode customization:** New settings for ambient mode. Ambient mode and Liquid Glass options are now searchable in settings.\r\n- **App icons:** Added the Echo Cat and Billie Eilish icons.\r\n- **Hero carousel fallback:** The Home carousel now falls back to library songs, so it is no longer empty on fresh installs.\r\n\r\n## Changed\r\n\r\n- **Force Opus Audio and HTTP/3 (Cronet) are now enabled by default.**\r\n  - A migration check applies the new defaults on fresh installs and updates.\r\n  - Opus reduces data usage by about 50% compared to AAC/M4A.\r\n  - Both can still be disabled in Content settings.\r\n- **Liquid Glass (Beta) restored:** Real-time backdrop blur is back across the Player, Mini Player, Queue and navigation bar.\r\n- **Floating navigation bar:**\r\n  - Tabs are now horizontal, and only the active tab shows its label.\r\n  - The bar height is standardized to 56dp to match the search button.\r\n  - The expanded Mini Player now matches the navigation bar's width and height.\r\n- **App Icon settings screen redesigned:**\r\n  - Icons are sorted alphabetically.\r\n  - Each icon has its own squircle card, matching the settings design system.\r\n  - The selected icon is highlighted, and the layout respects the mini-player insets.\r\n  - The toolbar background is now a solid surface color.\r\n- **Liquid Glass settings icons updated:**\r\n  - Surface Tint now uses a contrast icon.\r\n  - Glass Text Color has a new custom icon.\r\n  - Glass Player and Glass Mini Player now use a drag handle icon.\r\n- **Home hero carousel** now spans edge to edge.\r\n- **Search screen:**\r\n  - The outline border is removed from the search bar.\r\n  - Vertical spacing around the Explore tabs is reduced.\r\n  - A subtle divider now separates the tabs from the content grid.\r\n- **Lyrics rendering:** The blur effect is replaced with scale (1.0x active, 0.85x inactive) and opacity, which lowers GPU load.\r\n\r\n## Fixed\r\n\r\n- **Spotify import and sync:** Playlists no longer stop at 100 tracks. Pagination now uses the REST API, with batch limits reverted to avoid rate limiting (#329, #442).\r\n- **Lyrics performance:** Shimmering during auto-scroll is resolved (#361).\r\n- **Library FAB:** It no longer overlaps the Liquid Glass mini player.\r\n- **Artist header text:** It no longer becomes unreadable over bright images.\r\n- **App Icon settings:** The screen now scrolls.\r\n- **Speed Dial grid items:** They now fill the grid square, matching the Randomize button.\r\n- **Inline navigation tab:** The icon is now vertically centered with a 1:1 aspect ratio.\r\n- **My Top 50 and My Bottom 50 queries:**\r\n  - Hiding video songs no longer returns fewer than 50 tracks.\r\n  - Results now follow the correct ranking order.\r\n- **Library Playlists layout:** The Top and Bottom buttons now align with the other buttons in the row.\r\n- **Bottom playlist about section:** It now uses the correct localized text.\r\n\r\n## Known Bugs\r\n\r\nThe following issues are known and will be fixed in the upcoming update:\r\n\r\n- **AI lyrics translation:** Lyrics translation via AI is currently not working.\r\n\r\n## Removed\r\n\r\n- **Unused dependencies:** googleDriveApi, googleApiClient, playServicesAuth, androidx.browser and jsoup. playServicesLocation is kept because it is loaded via reflection for F-Droid compatibility.\r\n\r\n## Dependencies\r\n\r\n| Library | Previous | Updated |\r\n|---|---|---|\r\n| Room | 2.8.4 | 2.8.5 |\r\n| Protobuf | 4.33.5 | 4.35.0 |\r\n| Lottie | 6.6.2 | 6.6.6 |",
