dates\" button, replaced storage sliders with simple \"Clear Cache\" actions, removed redundant toggles from AI Hub and Listen Together, removed several edge-case toggles (lyrics blur, line spacing, network IP version, playlist visibility), and hardcoded double-tap seek to 10 seconds.\r\n- Added a disclaimer noting the external update site contains ads.\r\n- Fixed markdown changelog parsing so formatting renders correctly in update dialogs — contributed by **@Rajendra0309** ([[PR #364](https://github.com/EchoMusicApp/Echo-Music/pull/364)](https://github.com/EchoMusicApp/Echo-Music/pull/364), [[PR #352](https://github.com/EchoMusicApp/Echo-Music/pull/352)](https://github.com/EchoMusicApp/Echo-Music/pull/352)).\r\n- Replaced Privacy Policy/Terms links in the Settings footer with an informal \"in development\" message.\r\n- Redesigned the Settings screen: borderless search pill, grouped settings with solid backgrounds, no primary-color icon tints.\r\n\r\n**Visual Design (Nothing OS-style overhaul)**\r\n- Adopted a strict monochrome, high-contrast design language across the app, replacing Material 3 primary/tertiary color tints on buttons, icons, switches, and floating elements.\r\n- Redesigned Listen Together, Recognize Music, History, and Stats screens with flat, monochrome styling.\r\n- Squared artist profile pictures app-wide; miniplayer controls restyled as monochrome (album art stays circular).\r\n- Unified \"More options\" and Settings groups with consistent backgrounds and rounding; removed empty padding.\r\n- Removed grey background cards from the History screen for a flatter list view.\r\n- Enforced square thumbnails in the Stats grid to eliminate letterboxing.\r\n- Redesigned the bottom navbar: unified overflow menu and FAB into a single pill-shaped container, added a subtle border to match the miniplayer, and made it fully opaque.\r\n- Made the top navbar fully transparent, pinned it in place, and removed scroll-to-collapse behavior.\r\n- Fully removed the Liquid Glass Beta feature, including related files, modifiers, and preference keys.\r\n- Improved bottom sheet visibility in AMOLED pure-black theme.\r\n- Fixed a large empty gap in the Library Songs screen caused by an unnecessary layout container.\r\n\r\n**Other UI Refinements**\r\n- Create Playlist dialog: \"Normally\" and \"Create with AI\" now render as individually rounded cards; removed a redundant icon.\r\n- Sync Playlist toggle redesigned as a full-width list row.\r\n- Spotify Import dialog now matches the YouTube Music import dialog styling.\r\n- Discord integration page simplified: removed redundant shadow and header, grouped RPC and Logout actions into one row, restyled buttons as pill-shaped.\r\n- Fixed AI Hub icon color to match standard icon tint.",
